<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 class="reveal">Why it works better <em>together.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="belief-list">
      <div class="belief reveal">
        <div class="bn">01</div>
        <div><div class="bt">The insight survives the handoff</div><div class="bd">When strategy and production sit in different companies, the sharpest part of the idea is usually the first thing lost. Here the person who found the tension is in the room when it gets shot.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="belief reveal">
        <div class="bn">02</div>
        <div><div class="bt">Formats outlive campaigns</div><div class="bd">A campaign ends. A format compounds. We build ideas that can run again, travel further and carry a brand past a single quarter's budget.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="belief reveal">
        <div class="bn">03</div>
        <div><div class="bt">Distribution is designed in, not bolted on</div><div class="bd">We know how ideas travel because we've spent 12 years watching them do it. That shapes the work at the concept stage, not the media plan.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="belief reveal">
        <div class="bn">04</div>
        <div><div class="bt">We test on ourselves first</div><div class="bd">Our own IPs are the proving ground. Formats that work on our platforms are formats we can build with confidence for a brand.</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

